    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d19-a9">

                <pb facs="0060" n="794" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg794"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Exhibit</hi> 8.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><placeName type="venue"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Government
                                    Palace</hi></placeName>, <lb/>
                            <placeName type="city"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1889-04-26"><hi rendition="#italic">April 26,
                        1889</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">J. H. Hollander</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">present:</hi></p>
                <p>Yesterday the following decree was issued, saying: “Owing to the difficulty and
                    circumstances of the national treasury, the President of the Republic decrees
                    that the effects of the Government decree of the 6th of July last, relative to
                    taking subscriptions of the newspaper of this capital, called the La Estrella de
                    Guatemala and Guatemala Star, do hereby cease. Let it be communicated.
                    Rubricated by the President. Anguiana.”</p>
                <p>I am, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Anguiana.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
